&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:24pt;min-height:24pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;年金財政計算上の数理債務の額と最低責任準備金の額との合計額&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
